# DEPRECATED for Lambda Environment secrets.
# Production SMTP credentials must live in SSM Parameter Store:
#
#   /zerotica-contact/smtp-host       String
#   /zerotica-contact/smtp-user       String
#   /zerotica-contact/smtp-password   SecureString
#   /zerotica-contact/mail-to         String
#
# deploy-contact-aws.py no longer uploads EMAIL_* / CONTACT_INQUIRY_TO
# into Lambda Environment.
#
# Local Vite still uses .env.local / .env (see .env.example).
#
# Optional smoke-test email for: python3 scripts/deploy-contact-aws.py --send-test-mail
# CONTACT_TEST_EMAIL=you@example.com
